{"parentUuid":"c550736b-6cb1-4017-9b00-c3ddef3fe462","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"ae376dabbfd7a5096","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_016AfhmwaHidtDTdxjki8tK7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I have enough evidence. Key finding: the project ALREADY does fine-grained subset-based nogoods (placement_level_conflict_set, empty_binding_domain, blocked_ports), AND falls back to whole-layout for binding INFEASIBLE. Let me draft the verdict.\n\n---\n\n## 1. claim 出处\n\nR3 transcript `docs/research/agent_transcripts/af150891e26339789.output` 第 32 条 assistant 消息（offset ~1936）原话：\"Codato & Fischetti 2006 针对纯整数 master + 含 big-M 的 sub，cut 不依赖 big-M 而是从 minimal infeasible subsystems (MIS) 中提取纯组合不等式…我们 routing/binding 失败时目前生成的 no-good cut（\"这组 placement 全禁\"）非常弱。换成 \"这组 placement 中的某个最小不可路由子集禁\"会让 master 的 LP 松弛紧得多。**强烈推荐做。**\"。**transcript 没给具体的 -30% LP gap 数字**——路线图 v1 第 62 行 \"master LP gap -30%+\" 是路线图作者自己加的口径，agent 原文只是定性\"considerably tighter\"。**Red flag：数字凭空捏的**，且 agent 还误判我们当前 cut 是 whole-layout（其实只在 INFEASIBLE 通路是）。\n\n## 2. 论文核实\n\nWebSearch 命中 Codato & Fischetti, *Operations Research* 54(4):756-766 (2006)。原文 claim：\"automatic problem reformulation aimed at removing the model dependency on **big-M coefficients**…cuts associated to **minimal (or irreducible) infeasible subsystems**…produces an LP relaxation of the master problem which can be **considerably tighter**…computational results on **two specific classes of hard-to-solve MIPs** indicate the new method is some orders of magnitude faster\"。**关键限定**：(a) 论文 master 是 ILP/MILP（big-M 困境驱动），sub 是 LP；(b) 收益核心来自\"消除 big-M\"，不是单纯\"切得小\"；(c) 实验只覆盖两类问题（MKP variants 和 timetabling-类）。论文从未 claim 通用 -30%。后续 Hooker 系列（Logic-Based Benders, OR 2007, INFORMS Tutorials）把\"组合 cut\"概念推广到 CP master，但仍依赖子问题能给出 minimal infeasible subset。\n\n## 3. CP-SAT 契合度\n\nOR-Tools CP-SAT 底层就是 CDCL SAT solver（[CP-SAT Primer 07_under_the_hood](https://d-krupke.github.io/cpsat-primer/07_under_the_hood.html)），**已经在自动学习 minimal-ish 不可行子句**（learnt clause 来自 1UIP/conflict analysis）。CP-SAT 通过 `Solver.SufficientAssumptionsForInfeasibility()`（unsat core）能直接拿 minimal assumption set。**关键含义**：(a) 我们 master 是 CP-SAT，CBC 论文的 \"master ILP no continuous variables\" 跟我们契合度 OK；(b) 但 Codato-Fischetti 红利的\"消除 big-M LP relaxation 收紧\"对 CP-SAT 不直接适用——CP-SAT 没有 big-M 形式，它的 LP relaxation 是 propagator-driven；(c) 外部喂 `AddBoolOr(NOT x_i for i in MIS)` 形式的 cut 仍然有效，因为它是结构化先验。\n\n## 4. 当前项目 cut 实现状况\n\n`src/search/benders_loop.py:4480-4555` 显示**双层并存**：\n- **subset-based (已实现)**：`binding_pose_domain_empty_nogood` (3936)、`routing_front_blocked_nogood` (4179) 都用 `_build_conflict_from_instance_ids` 从 `placement_level_conflict_set`/`blocked_port` 抽出**真正的最小子集**\n- **whole-layout fallback (4053)**：仅当 `binding_status == \"INFEASIBLE\"` 全局不可绑、或 routing 全模型超时时退化\n- `binding_subproblem.py:673` `extract_empty_binding_domain_instances` 已经吐每实例级 conflict\n- `cut_manager.py:280-307` 注册结构化 cut，按 frozenset 去重\n\n**结论**：whole-layout 不是默认路径，只是兜底。agent 的\"我们目前是 whole-layout\"判断**过时**。\n\n## 5. 真实工程量\n\n要把现在的 fallback 也升级成 MIS：(a) `binding_status == INFEASIBLE` 时调用 CP-SAT `SufficientAssumptionsForInfeasibility` 并把 binding 选择 mark 为 assumptions（binding_subproblem 现在 `Add(sum<=n-1)`，要重构成 assumption 模式）——~2 天；(b) routing TIMEOUT/INFEASIBLE 时 deletion-filter 跑 k 次 routing（每次 10-60s），266 设施下成本恶心——~3-4 天 + 可能负 ROI；(c) 加 BendersCut metadata 区分 \"MIS-derived\" vs \"whole-layout\"，写测试——~1 天。**总计 5-7 天**，跟路线图 1 周对得上，但收益面已被既有 fine-grained cut 吃掉一大半。\n\n## verdict\n\n**GO-WITH-CAVEATS（降级 P1→P2，缩范围）**\n\n1. **\"-30% LP gap\" 数字纯属编造**，论文只 claim \"considerably tighter on two MIP classes\"——同 R12 推翻 shared_tree/portfolio 的同款病灶（agent 给数字、源码不支持）\n2. **核心红利已被吃掉一半**：`binding_pose_domain_empty_nogood` + `routing_front_blocked_nogood` 已经是 placement-level minimal subset，不是 whole-layout\n3. **CP-SAT CDCL 自动在学 minimal clause**，外部 MIS 提取是冗余先验，不是新算法红利\n4. **唯一真实可改进点**：把 `binding_INFEASIBLE_nogood` 和 routing TIMEOUT 兜底从 whole-layout 升级到 unsat-core MIS。这是 ~2-3 天工作量、不是 1 周；ROI 大概 1.3-1.8x（远低于 5x 估计），且只在 INFEASIBLE 兜底才生效\n\n**建议改 P2、估时 2-3 天、目标\"消除 whole-layout fallback\"而不是\"升级所有 cut\"**。优先级让位给 P1 #9 storage-box overload nogood（已在做、ROI 实测）。\n\n**关键文件**：`src/search/benders_loop.py:4039-4063` (whole-layout 兜底), `src/search/benders_loop.py:4149-4190` (已存在的 subset cut 模板可复用), `src/models/binding_subproblem.py:676-692` (`add_nogood_cut` 当前用 sum<=n-1，需改成 assumption-based 才能拿 unsat core)\n\n**Sources**:\n- [Codato & Fischetti — Combinatorial Benders' Cuts (OR 2006)](https://pubsonline.informs.org/doi/abs/10.1287/opre.1060.0286)\n- [Semantic Scholar PDF](https://www.semanticscholar.org/paper/Combinatorial-Benders'-Cuts-for-Mixed-Integer-Codato-Fischetti/7ba61b0c68ee3b4557d888146f0f109593d96470)\n- [CP-SAT Primer — Under the Hood (CDCL)](https://d-krupke.github.io/cpsat-primer/07_under_the_hood.html)\n- [or-tools issue #973: Best way to find infeasible constraints](https://github.com/google/or-tools/issues/973)"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3444,"cache_read_input_tokens":53802,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3444,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}},"requestId":"req_011CasR9TUw1L5hrgEzFGoXF","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"a2b143a2-e825-40d2-8118-3c4e421f4628","timestamp":"2026-05-09T17:50:26.900Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
